\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 Thi h\'e0nh Nghi quy\u7871\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 10-CP  ng\'e0y 8/1/1978 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3f \'f0\u7891\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\u7873\'3f c\'f4ng t\'e1c gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f trong t}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'ecnh h\'ecnh m\u7899\'3fi. Li\'ean b\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - L}{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'fd\'f5ngth\u7921\'3fc v\'e0 th\u7921\'3fc ph\u7849\'3fm quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\'e1
c nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc thu thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 gi\'e1 \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn th\'f3c thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp gi\u7919\'3fa ng\'e0nh T\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 ng\'e0nh l\'fd
\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f n\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc nh\'fd sau:
\par 1/ V\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc thu thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 gi\'e1 \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn mua, b\'e1n th\'f3c thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp:
\par + Thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp thu nh\u7919\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi th\'f3c \'f0\u7911\'3f ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn t\u7889\'3ft \u7903\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng v\'e0 \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'e3 ph}{
\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'f5i kh\'f4, qu\u7841\'3ft s\u7841\'3fch. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft n\'f5i n\'e0o \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f b\u7857\'3fng th\'f3c \'fd\u7899\'3f
t sang kh\'f4 m\'e0 ph\u7843\'3fi t\'e3ng s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng th\'f3c \'fd\u7899\'3ft cho \'f0\u7911\'3f m\u7913\'3fc th\'f3c kh\'f4 ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f do Ty l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f U\u7927
\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 To\'e0n b\u7897\'3f th\'f3c thu thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp do ng\'e0}{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 nh l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc c\'e2n nh\u7853\'3f
n c\u7911\'3fa nh\'e2n d\'e2n \'f0\u7875\'3f nh\u7853\'3fp kho l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. Khi c\'e2n nh\u7853\'3fp kho, th\u7911\'3f kho ph\u7843\'3fi ph\'e1t phi\u7871\'3fu bi\'ean lai (5 b\u7843\'3fn) th\u7911\'3f kho l\'fdu 1 b
\u7843\'3fn, g\u7917\'3fi Ty l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc 1 b\u7843\'3fn, giao cho ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f 1 b\u7843\'3fn, U\u7927\'3f ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n x}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'e3 m\u7897\'3ft b\u7843\'3fn v
\'e0 ph\'f2ng t\'e0i ch\'ednh}{\f59\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581  huy\u7879\'3fn 1 b\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f theo d}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'f5i, ki\u7875\'3fm tra, }{
\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'f0\'f4n \'f0\u7889\'3fc thu n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0 l\'e0m ch\u7913\'3fng t\u7915\'3f thanh to\'e1n thu\u7871\'3f. Ngo\'e0i c\'f5 quan l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc, tuy\u7879\'3ft \'f0\u7889\'3fi kh
\'f4ng m\u7897\'3ft t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ho\u7841\'3fc c\'e1 nh\'e2n n\'e0o \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu nh\u7853\'3fn th\'f3c v\'e0 c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par }{\f59\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 + Gi\'e1 \'f0\u7875\'3f thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3f th\'f3c th}{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 u\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\u7875\'3f ng\'e0nh l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc n
\u7897\'3fp ti\u7873\'3fn v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc l\'e0 gi\'e1 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0a\u7885\'3f thu mua trong k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch th\'f3c t\u7867\'3f ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn lo\u7841\'3fi 1 \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng v\'f9ng t\u7841
\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng theo Ngh\u7883\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 10-CP ng\'e0y 8 th\'e1ng 1 n\'e3m 1978 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7897\'3fi \'f0\u7891\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f. S\u7889\'3f th\'f3c thu thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp \u7903
\'3f v\'f9ng n\'e0o s\u7869\'3f thanh to\'e1n theo gi\'e1 th\'f3c t\u7867\'3f ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn lo\u7841\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft \u7903\'3f v\'f9ng \'f0\'f3.
\par Th\u7901\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn th\'f3c thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp theo gi\'e1 m\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft c\'f9ng th\u7901\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm thi h\'e0
nh gi\'e1 m\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f thu mua th\'f3c c\u7911\'3fa nh\'e2n d\'e2n. N\'f5i n\'e0o \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'e3 thanh to\'e1n theo gi\'e1 c\u361\'75 th\'ec nay ph\u7843\'3fi thanh to\'e1n l\u7841\'3fi v\u7899
\'3fi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n}{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'fd\u7899\'3fc theo gi\'e1 m\u7899\'3fi.
