\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'e3 giao cho t\u7915\'3fng }{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f theo gi\'e1 th\'f3c t\u7867\'3f ti\'ea
