\u7843\'3f }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 ngay cho c\'e1c h\u7897\'3f n\'f4ng d\'e2n b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn m\u7863\'3ft; tr\u7843\'3f cho c\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c x\'e3 b\u7857\'3fng chuy\u7875\'3fn kho\u7843\'3fn qua Ng\'e2n h
\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n}{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'fd\u7899\'3fc); khi ng\'e0nh L\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\u7851\'3fn theo gi\'e1 th\'f3c t\u7867\'3f ti\'eau chu\u7849
\'3fn lo\u7841\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft trong k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng v\'f9ng t\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 3/ Vi\u7879\'3fc thu thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp b\u7857\'3fng n\'f4ng s\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1c v\'e0 b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn thay th\'f3c:
