ng nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'e2y th\u7921\'3fc ph\u7849\'3fm th\'ec }{\f67\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid13783153\charrsid9457581 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc n\u7897\'3fp m\u7897\'3ft ph\u7847\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f thu\u7871\'3f n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp b\u7857
