p kho, thu mua theo gi\'e1 ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi, chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn thu mua l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc \'f0\'f3 n\u7897\'3fp v\'e0o ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 c
