\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi s\u7889\'3f b\'f9 ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa ng\'e0nh l\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc c\u361\'3fng t\'e3ng, B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh, B\u7897\'3f L\'fd\'f5ng th\u7921\'3fc v\'e0 c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph
